      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Hi, I am Row-Haan and this video is about how Spotify picks songs: how an app guesses what you'll want to hear next. Spotify doesn't publish its recipe, so I built a small recommender to see how the idea works.",
