    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "EXPLORE",
      "narration_text": "So I gave two of every ten slots to songs few people had heard. Almost the whole catalogue came into play, and the biggest hits' share of the slots fell from seventy-six to sixty-three percent. Spotify experiments with exploration too.",
